JSON_Attribute_Watermark.description:
Given a Contract JSON attribute with the following jsonValue:

```json
{
  "customer": {"name": "Acme"},
  "items": [
    {"description": "First"},
    {"description": "Second"},
    {"description": "Third"}
  ]
}
```

The expected rendered text is "Acme — Third". Contract[0] selects the attribute
value, while items[2] selects the third element within its JSON array.
